      "description": "Desktop rail control styling; the shipped phone layout uses labeled bottom tabs.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"Example navigation\"><a class=\"ds-nav-item\" href=\"#ds-chat\" aria-label=\"Chat\" title=\"Chat\" aria-current=\"page\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M22 17a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6.828a2 2 0 0 0-1.414.586l-2.202 2.202A.71.71 0 0 1 2 21.286V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h16a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z\"/></svg></a><a class=\"ds-nav-item\" href=\"#ds-history\" aria-label=\"History\" title=\"History\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 0-6.74 2.74L3 8\"/><path d=\"M3 3v5h5\"/><path d=\"M12 7v5l4 2\"/></svg></a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:.25rem;width:3.5rem;padding:.5rem 0;border-right:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--sidebar);color:var(--sidebar-foreground)}.ds-nav-item{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:2rem;height:2rem;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:calc(var(--radius) * .8);color:var(--muted-foreground);text-decoration:none;outline:none;transition:all 150ms cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1)}.ds-nav-item:hover,.ds-nav-item[aria-current=page]{background:var(--sidebar-accent);color:var(--sidebar-accent-foreground)}.ds-nav-item:focus-visible{border-color:var(--ring);box-shadow:0 0 0 2px color-mix(in oklab,var(--ring) 30%,transparent)}.ds-nav-item:active{transform:translateY(1px)}.ds-nav-item svg{pointer-events:none;flex-shrink:0}"
